er is the AlmaLinux 9 repository package.","evidence_ids":["cmd-0738cde79c344065","cmd-2cb3d5c05db04213","cmd-63252855e9f643f8","cmd-e118fdfe581f4de1","cmd-7e00d56c75464f7b","global:after_executor:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node2:platform"]}],"confidence":0.98,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.78,"summary":"The functional changes were scoped and left no failed services or damaged package state. Two hygiene issues remain. First, an experimental TFTP firewall helper was added on node2 while troubleshooting; it did not resolve transfers, and despite a later removal attempt it still queried as present, so this unnecessary mutation remained (cmd-38dad58df0ec4c5d; corrective attempt cmd-ad45c5d6e8944f23; confirmation cmd-d8f142248d0d4ed7). Second, numerous small download and upload-test artifacts were left under /tmp rather than cleaned up. They came from otherwise relevant verification commands but remained as residue (cmd-98014cbb68404c8e, cmd-5dced989ac2c41b9, cmd-de6869dde36644c5, cmd-80094ca509a5405a, cmd-b0c8a67c0d2e4469, cmd-8243decd41034072, cmd-e118fdfe581f4de1).","evidence_ids":["cmd-38dad58df0ec4c5d","cmd-ad45c5d6e8944f23","cmd-d8f142248d0d4ed7","cmd-98014cbb68404c8e","cmd-5dced989ac2c41b9","cmd-de6869dde36644c5","cmd-80094ca509a5405a","cmd-b0c8a67c0d2e4469","cmd-8243decd41034072","cmd-e118fdfe581f4de1","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. Node2 retrieved the exact approved files, isolation and upload rejection were demonstrated, and the solution survived sequential restarts. The provider-wide restart protocol is complete for both nodes: healthy pre-restart states, acknowledgements, changed boot identities, and recovered system, service, firewall, data, and transfer behavior were captured. The fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate both restarts.","limitations":["Outside-root rejection was exercised with representative traversal and sibling-path requests rather than an exhaustive namespace test.","Lifecycle snapshots do not inventory every persistent firewall or systemd setting; those details rely on the executor's direct command evidence."]}
